{
  "id": "ep50-vo-01",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "01_H1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "财、货、贵，都带个贝，偏偏钱，是金字旁。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "01_H1.mp3",
      "bytes": 94501,
      "heard": "财、货、贵都带个贝,偏偏钱是金字旁。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 5.84
    },
    {
      "name": "02_H2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你扫码付的钱，倒回一千年，只是一张纸。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "02_H2.mp3",
      "bytes": 72767,
      "heard": "你扫馬付的錢倒回一千年,只是一張紙。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.48
    },
    {
      "name": "03_H3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "倒回三千多年，钱是一枚贝壳。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "03_H3.mp3",
      "bytes": 66498,
      "heard": "倒回三千多年,錢是一枚貝殼。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 4.08
    },
    {
      "name": "04_B2a",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "贝壳从很远的海边运来，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "04_B2a.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "贝壳从很远的海边运来",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "05_B2b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "稀少、结实，又好带。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "05_B2b.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "稀少,劫事,又好戴!",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "06_B3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "商代晚期，还有了青铜铸的贝。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "06_B3.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "商代晚期 还有了青铜柱的备",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "07_C1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "那钱，为什么是金字旁？",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "07_C1.mp3",
      "bytes": 44764,
      "heard": "那前为什么是金字旁?",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 2.72
    },
    {
      "name": "08_C2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "钱，铫也，古田器也。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "08_C2.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "前、弱也、古田气也。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "09_C3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "原来，钱是一把铲子。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "09_C3.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "原来钱是一把铲子",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "10_C4a",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "东周时，人们照着铲子铸铜币，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "10_C4a.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "東周時,人們照著鏟子鑄銅壁",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "11_C4b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "名字也跟着叫钱。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "11_C4b.mp3",
      "bytes": 34315,
      "heard": "名字也跟着叫前。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "name": "12_D1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "战国各国的钱，有刀、铲、圆、贝。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "12_D1.mp3",
      "bytes": 76529,
      "heard": "战国各国的钱有刀、铲、圆、背。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "name": "13_E1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "秦统一六国，也统一了钱。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "13_E1.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "秦统一六国也统一了钱。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "14_E2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "钱上写着半两，就得重半两。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "14_E2.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "前上写着半辆就得重半辆",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "15_F1a",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "汉朝的五铢，名字也是重量，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "15_F1a.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "heard": "漢朝的五珠名字也是重量",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "name": "16_F1b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一用七百多年，从汉用到唐。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "16_F1b.mp3",
      "bytes": 62318,
      "heard": "一用七百多年,從漢用到唐。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.84
    },
    {
      "name": "17_G1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "废五铢钱，行开元通宝钱。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "17_G1.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "废五珠前行開源通報前",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "18_G2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "新钱的名字，不再是重量。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "18_G2.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "新前的名字不再是重量",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "19_S1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "北宋的四川，用的是铁钱。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "19_S1.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "北宋的四川用的是鐵錢",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "20_S2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一串一千文，重二十五斤八两。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "20_S2.mp3",
      "bytes": 59811,
      "heard": "一串一千吻 中二十五斤八两。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "name": "21_S3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "患蜀人铁钱重，不便贸易。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "21_S3.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "坏属人铁钱众,不便贸易。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "22_S3b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "川蜀铁钱十枚，才抵一枚铜钱。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "22_S3b.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "穿梳铁钱十枚才比一枚同钱",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "23_S4a",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "于是有了交子：",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "23_S4a.mp3",
      "bytes": 33061,
      "heard": "于是有了胶子。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "name": "24_S4b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一张纸，能换一千文。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "24_S4b.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "一张纸能换一千文",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "25_S5a",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "起初，十六家富户发交子，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "25_S5a.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "起初16家户户发胶子。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "26_S5b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "后来换不回钱，官司不断。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "26_S5b.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "后来换不回钱,官司不断。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "27_S6",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一零二四年，官府接手交子。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "27_S6.mp3",
      "bytes": 54795,
      "heard": "1024年,官府接手交字。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.36
    },
    {
      "name": "28_S7",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "它是世界上最早的纸币之一。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "28_S7.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "它是世界上最早的紙幣之一。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "29_S8",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "红黑套印，暗藏编号，防人伪造。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "29_S8.mp3",
      "bytes": 59811,
      "heard": "红黑套印 暗藏编号 防人伪造。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "name": "30_M1a",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "明初，官府印宝钞：",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "30_M1a.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "明初 官府印保抄",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.992,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "31_M1b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一贯，等于一千文，等于一两银。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "31_M1b.mp3",
      "bytes": 65244,
      "heard": "一貫等於一千文等於一兩銀",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 4.0
    },
    {
      "name": "32_M1c",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "可官府印得太多，又收不回来。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "32_M1c.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "可官府印得太多,又收不回来。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "33_M2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "钞一贯不能直钱一文。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "33_M2.mp3",
      "bytes": 39331,
      "heard": "超一貫不能值錢一文",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.99,
      "seconds": 2.4
    },
    {
      "name": "34_M3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "纸不灵了，明朝人改用白银。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "34_M3.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "只不灵了 明朝人改用白银",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "35_M4a",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "白银每次都要称，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "35_M4a.mp3",
      "bytes": 33061,
      "heard": "白银每次都要撑",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "name": "36_M4b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "钱又回到了看重量。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "36_M4b.mp3",
      "bytes": 36823,
      "heard": "錢又回到了看重量",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 2.24
    },
    {
      "name": "37_R1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一九四八年，人民币来了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "37_R1.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "1948年 人民币来了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "38_T1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "如今，十点一七亿人用网络支付。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "38_T1.mp3",
      "bytes": 61065,
      "heard": "如今,10.17亿人用网络支付。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.76
    },
    {
      "name": "39_P1a",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "钱越变越轻：",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "39_P1a.mp3",
      "bytes": 31807,
      "heard": "前越变越轻",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.987,
      "seconds": 1.92
    },
    {
      "name": "40_P1b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "贝壳、铜、纸，最后是一串数字。",
